        <p>CABINET FURNITUEIII.</p>
        <p>Two very substantial Dining room Suite., with carved antique oak frames. upholstered in best selected moroccs hair stuffed, couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel back chairs, £33 10a. ; reduced to £2B. One Very Superior Dining-room Suite, in rich Pollard oak. upholstered in best mamma, stuffed hair, couch, gent's, lady's, and six chairs. £3l 100. ; reduced to £26. Three very choice Dining-room Suites, one each in dark oak, walnut, and mahogany, upholsterod ittuelected moroccs, stuffed hair, conch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-back chairs, £27 10'.; reduced to £22. One Very handsome Dining-room Suite. in carved antique oak, upholstered in mohair velvet, couch, Rent's, lady's. and six panel-back chairs. £26 10s. ; reduced to £2l. Three very useful Dining-room Suites, one each dark oak walnut and mahogany, upholstered in crocodile morocoos, couch, gent's, lady's, and six-panel back chairs, £25 10s. ; reduced to £2l. Three Strong Reliable Dining-room Suites, one each in dark oak, mahogany and walnut, in real morocoos. couch, gent's, lady's, and six chairs. £22 10s. ; reduced to £l9 10s. Three Very Useful Dining-room Suites, one each ,dark oak, walnut and mahogruay. upholstered in moroccos,stuffed hair, couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-back chairs, £2l; re- duced to £l7 10s. Three Very Luxurious Dining-room Suites, one each dark oak, walnut and mahogany. upholstered in saddlebags and velvet, couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-back chairs, £2l; reduced to £lB. Two Very Useful Dining-room Suites, one each in dark oak and walnut, hair stuffed and covered in real morocoo, couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-back chairs, £lB 10s. ; reduced to £l5. Two Reliable Dining-room Suites, one each mahogany and walnut, hair-stuffed, and covered in real moreecoo, couch, gent's, lady's, and six chairs, £lB 10s ; reduced to £l5 10a. Three Very Useful Dining-room Suites, one each in dark oak, walnut, and mahowany, couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-back chairs, £l6 10i;