        <p>One very useful Dining-room Suite in mahogany, uphol- stered in saddlebags and velvet, couch, gent's, lady's and six panel-back chairs. £l3 108 ; reduced to £ll 10s. Three substantial Dining-room Suites, in mahogany, dark oak, and walnut, upholstered in saddlebags and velvet,oouch, • gent's, lady's, and six chaise, Rl2 108 ; reduced to £lO. One strong well-made Dining-room Bette, upholstered in pantasote:. couch, gent's, lady's, and six panel-bask chairs, £l2 15s. Reduced to £lO.</p>
        <p>ALL DINING-ROOM SUITES REDUCED IN PRICE.</p>
        <p>Three very superior Sideboards, one each in mahogany, dark oak, and walnut, 6tt. wide, 7ft. 21n. high, witlicarved panels, cupboards, drawers, and three bevelled plates, £23 10s. Reduced to £2l. One Very Substtntial Sideboard, in dark oak, 6 feet wide, 7 feet 1 inch high. with cupboards, drawers, carved panels, and three bevelled plates, £2l ; reduced to £l7 10s. Three very massive Sideboards, one each mahogany, dark oak, and walnut, 6 feet wide, 6 feet 10 inches high, with carved panels, drawers, cupboards, and three bevelled plates. £lB 10s; reduced to £l5, One massive Sideboard, in American walnut, 6 feet wide, 8 feet 6 inches high, with shelves, carved panels. drawers, ' pillars, cupboards, and seven bevelled plates, £lB 10s; re- duced to £l3 10s Two very Handsome Sideboards, one each in mahogany and dark oak, 6 feet wide. 7 feet 10 inches high. with carved panels, shelves, drawers, ostlarette ani six bevelled plates, £1710.. Reduced to £1310.. One Superior Sideboard, in walnut, 6 feet wide, 7 feet 9 inches high, with cupboards, drawers, carved panels, and four bevelled plates, £l5 10s. Reduced to £l3.</p>
        <p>Six Massive Sideboards, three in dark oak, two in maho- gany, and one in walnut, 6 feet wide, 7 feet 9 inches high, with drawers, shelves, carved panels, cupboards, and three bevelled plates, 212 15e. Reduced to 211.</p>
        <p>ALL SIDEBOARDS REDUCED IN PRICE. Over 100 In Stock to Select from.</p>
