      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1896-02-29_WidnesExaminer_art0018" n="art0018">
        <head>WOMEN'S CHAT.</head>
        <p>WOMEN'S CHAT.</p>
        <p>Although it is whispered that cycling among the "leisured classes " is already beginning to be numbered among crazes of the past,there is at present no apparent diminution in the fair army of wheelwomen. For my own part I regard any falling off in tone as less serious than the increase of danger occasioned by the crowd of incompetents who hazard not only their own necks but other people's by attempting fancy riding, which in truth is neither pretty, graceful, nor in any way deair- !</p>
