        <p>LATE THE PROPERTY OF A DOCTOR AT HIGHER BROUGHTON. This lot was let on hire by a house who charged £175 for them ; the lot wants seeing to effect a speedy sale; magnifi- cent dining-room in solid walnut (the sideboard is well worth £25). the drawing-room in inlaid rosewood. the bedrooms are In satin walnut wood and American walnut, grand bedsteads, oil painting, kitchen furniture, dinner set, and sundries; space prevents anything like a complete list, call to see them. Don't forget they were sent out on hire for £175 ; my price, £5B, or 5 per cent. extra on the deferred payment system.</p>
