        <p>GERSHON'S UNIVERSAL FURNISHING ARCADE, 44, Oldham-atrect, Manchester next to the Adelphl Bank.</p>
        <p>Li THE PROPERTY OF A BANKRUPT i SILF. MERCHANT. Without doubt the handsomest fittings for a dining-room ever seen. Money- cannot buy better. The small chairs are most handsomely carved. The lounge chairs and;couch are all upholstered in a real crocodile leather, everlasting wear. The handsome sideboard. overmantel. and large extending dining table are all in dark (nearty black)Chippendale maho- gany. I am informed they cost nearly £200; can now be had for 68 guineas, I have also the drawing room, which is simply magnificent, and a number of bedroom suites. One suite is in real satinwooct, richly inlaid, and I know for a positive fact it cost two years since 250 guineas, and is now on offer for 85 guineas. *wither massive suite in solid wal- nutwood cannot Le described, it's quite equal to new, in fact, better. it cost £9s—the invoice is in my possession—can now be had for 55 guineas, warranted and delivered.</p>
