        <p>A. PRIVATE GENTLEMAN with it big capital at his disposal is open to advance Loans daily from £2 upwards. No fees charged. No security required. Simply on note of hand. Distance no object. —Apply personally or by letter to MANAGF.n, 6, Cross Lane, Harlestown (private house). Hours 9 am. to 8 p.m. Strictest privacy guaran- teed. Special terms to Farmers.</p>
